    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664600/extras/b902bc5657846580861a504cb6df819a.poster.avif?t=1749741017\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664600/extras/b902bc5657846580861a504cb6df819a.webm?t=1749741017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664600/extras/b902bc5657846580861a504cb6df819a.mp4?t=1749741017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cast your rod in zero gravity and reel in the weirdest catches the galaxy has to offer\u2014welcome to GLORB, the ultimate space fishing adventure!</strong><br>Solo or co-op, you\u2019ll fish for bizarre lifeforms called Glorbs (Gross Lumpy Organisms Roaming Blorptown), each with unique traits, behaviors, and delicious potential. Catch them, contain them, and cook them into galaxy-famous snacks like GLORB Hotdogs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Glorb you fish up affects gameplay: what you can craft, how you expand, and what chaos ensues when you test your creations yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664600/extras/9a8aa4eba264f4093565dbbdce2ba22a.poster.avif?t=1749741017\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664600/extras/9a8aa4eba264f4093565dbbdce2ba22a.webm?t=1749741017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664600/extras/9a8aa4eba264f4093565dbbdce2ba22a.mp4?t=1749741017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your convenience store empire with automation, alien customers, and shady snacks. Set prices, optimize your supply chain, and upgrade your fishing gear\u2014from scrap rods to high tech equipment. Breed rarer Glorbs, build smarter setups, and keep up with ever-shifting market demands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Fishing &amp; Exploration</strong> \u2013 Use rods of various quality, and more to catch wild Glorbs across space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creature Collection</strong> \u2013 Each Glorb is unique; breed and collect them for size, traits and profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snack Crafting</strong> \u2013 Cook up suspicious goods, including the famous GLORB Slurpie.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automation &amp; Management</strong> \u2013 Run a smooth pipeline from fishing to checkout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Economy</strong> \u2013 Prices shift, demands change\u2014sell smart or go broke.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Expansion</strong> \u2013 Customize and grow your asteroid into a snack-selling hotspot.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish weird. Sell weirder. Welcome to GLORB.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664600/extras/b902bc5657846580861a504cb6df819a.poster.avif?t=1749741017\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664600/extras/b902bc5657846580861a504cb6df819a.webm?t=1749741017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664600/extras/b902bc5657846580861a504cb6df819a.mp4?t=1749741017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cast your rod in zero gravity and reel in the weirdest catches the galaxy has to offer\u2014welcome to GLORB, the ultimate space fishing adventure!</strong><br>Solo or co-op, you\u2019ll fish for bizarre lifeforms called Glorbs (Gross Lumpy Organisms Roaming Blorptown), each with unique traits, behaviors, and delicious potential. Catch them, contain them, and cook them into galaxy-famous snacks like GLORB Hotdogs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Glorb you fish up affects gameplay: what you can craft, how you expand, and what chaos ensues when you test your creations yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664600/extras/9a8aa4eba264f4093565dbbdce2ba22a.poster.avif?t=1749741017\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664600/extras/9a8aa4eba264f4093565dbbdce2ba22a.webm?t=1749741017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664600/extras/9a8aa4eba264f4093565dbbdce2ba22a.mp4?t=1749741017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your convenience store empire with automation, alien customers, and shady snacks. Set prices, optimize your supply chain, and upgrade your fishing gear\u2014from scrap rods to high tech equipment. Breed rarer Glorbs, build smarter setups, and keep up with ever-shifting market demands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Fishing &amp; Exploration</strong> \u2013 Use rods of various quality, and more to catch wild Glorbs across space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creature Collection</strong> \u2013 Each Glorb is unique; breed and collect them for size, traits and profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snack Crafting</strong> \u2013 Cook up suspicious goods, including the famous GLORB Slurpie.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automation &amp; Management</strong> \u2013 Run a smooth pipeline from fishing to checkout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Economy</strong> \u2013 Prices shift, demands change\u2014sell smart or go broke.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Expansion</strong> \u2013 Customize and grow your asteroid into a snack-selling hotspot.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish weird. Sell weirder. Welcome to GLORB.</p>",
    "short_description": "Space fishing like you\u2019ve never seen it! Catch bizarre Glorbs, upgrade your rod, and reel in rarer species. Play solo or co-op, and sell your haul to hungry aliens across the galaxy!",
